Also `yaml.compose` for duplicate key detection — root mapping duplicate keys. Implement:

```python
def duplicate_top_level_keys(path):
    node = yaml.compose(Path(path).read_text())
    seen, dups = {}, []
    if isinstance(node, yaml.MappingNode):
        for k, v in node.value:
            name = k.value
            seen[name] = seen.get(name,0)+1
    return {k:c for k,c in seen.items() if c>1}
```

Note: `yaml.compose` on duplicate keys is fine (doesn't error).

